{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p005424","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p005424"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p005424","label":"車丞相未詳名（張丞相列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"車丞相","mention_ids":["c-shiji-096-zhang:m022-0001"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m022-0001","chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:p022","quote":"車丞相"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m022-0001","start":1,"end":4,"surface":"車丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005424","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:p022","chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji096-067","person_id":"cbr-p005424","title":"丞相","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","source_id":"s-shiji-096-zhang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:p022","quote":"有車丞相，長陵人也。卒而有韋丞相代。韋丞相賢者，魯人也。以讀書術為吏，至大鴻臚。有相工相之，當至丞相。有男四人，使相工相之，至第二子，其名玄成。相工曰：「此子貴，當封。」韋丞相言曰：「我即為丞相，有長子，是安從得之？」後竟為丞相，病死，而長子有罪論，不得嗣，而立玄成。玄成時佯狂，不肯立，竟立之，有讓國之名。後坐騎至廟，不敬，有詔奪爵一級，為關內侯，失列侯，得食其故國邑。韋丞相卒，有魏丞相代。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji096-067:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:p022","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"丞相","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m022-0001","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"原文實授、轉任、用稱與諡稱分存；未明示時任期起訖未知。欲任竇廣國及欲令周苛將皆不作實授；死亡或首次用稱不自動作任期端點。十四年、四年、二年等先保留原語，不擅定年號或西曆。曹窋免職段含（不）異文，未先強定其終點。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[{"id":"pa-shiji096-005","person_id":"cbr-p005424","relation":"biographical_origin","place":{"source_name":"長陵","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","